From 6297f13068082e82ccb5add44a80d0c44359447a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LightMoss <lightmoss@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:54:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Input: odroidgo3-joypad: no 1 s rumble at probe

The probe ran the rumble for a second with msleep(1000). The driver is
built in (and probes from a late_initcall), so that second was spent
inside the kernel's initcalls: the root filesystem was mounted, and
userspace started, a second later on every boot (joypad_probe took
1.007 s on a G80CA with the 4.4 kernel). On the G80CA the "rumble" is
the blue LED, so all it did was blink it at boot.

Port of LightMoss's patch for the 4.4 kernel (board/r36s/linux/patches/
0010-input-odroidgo3-joypad-no-rumble-at-probe.patch).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QTkmtGvwQ3V8JXzMT2JqWV
---
 drivers/input/joystick/odroidgo3-joypad.c | 13 +++----------
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/input/joystick/odroidgo3-joypad.c b/drivers/input/joystick/odroidgo3-joypad.c
index 5dc606e34..e5290b360 100644
--- a/drivers/input/joystick/odroidgo3-joypad.c
+++ b/drivers/input/joystick/odroidgo3-joypad.c
@@ -2911,17 +2911,10 @@ static int joypad_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 		return error;
 
 	/*
-	 * 启动震动: 探测时振动1秒.
-	 * 在注册输入设备之前完成, 使 sysfs 属性 (dev_groups, 探测返回后创建)
-	 * 与输入设备几乎同时出现.
+	 * LightMoss: no 1 s rumble at probe. The driver is built in, so its
+	 * msleep(1000) held up the whole kernel boot (and the root mount) by
+	 * a second, to blink the LED that stands in for the G80CA's motor.
 	 */
-	if (joypad->has_rumble) {
-		joypad->level = 0xFFFF;
-		joypad_vibrator_start(joypad);
-		msleep(1000);
-		joypad_vibrator_stop(joypad);
-		joypad->level = 0;
-	}
 
 	/* 轮询输入设备设置 */
 	error = joypad_input_setup(dev, joypad);
